From: Research Team <research@example.local>
Date: Sun, 3 May 2026 13:10:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 0002/0003] RFC: mm: wire semantic madvise to vma metadata

// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
/* RFC ONLY – NOT FOR SUBMISSION */

This patch updates the madvise handler to record the requested
semantic hint into the VMA's metadata field.

If a VMA already has a semantic hint, it is overwritten by the
latest call, ensuring only one intent signal is active per region.

Signed-off-by: Research Team <research@example.local>
---
 mm/madvise.c | 12 +++++++++---
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mm/madvise.c b/mm/madvise.c
index a828f80..b938c90 100644
--- a/mm/madvise.c
+++ b/mm/madvise.c
@@ -1095,9 +1095,15 @@ static int madvise_vma_behavior(struct vm_area_struct *vma,
 	case MADV_COLLAPSE:
 		return madvise_collapse(vma, prev, start, end);
 	case MADV_SEMANTIC_STREAMING:
+		vma->vm_semantic_hint = VM_SEMANTIC_STREAMING;
+		return 0;
 	case MADV_SEMANTIC_REUSE:
+		vma->vm_semantic_hint = VM_SEMANTIC_REUSE;
+		return 0;
 	case MADV_SEMANTIC_EPHEMERAL:
-		/* RFC: Logic/Policy deferred to Milestone 3 */
+		vma->vm_semantic_hint = VM_SEMANTIC_EPHEMERAL;
 		return 0;
 	}
 
